  "description": "VICKID crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P -4 21 c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C148 H112 Dy8 N12 O44 Si1. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors; Dy7 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy8 (Dy) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 14 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.793-4.493 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 102.54-125.84°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C148H108Dy8N12O44Si.",
